    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University's Communicators' Network June meeting was the forum for a special presentation by Ruby Lee, Digital Communications Manager, Advancement Office, University of Melbourne. The presentation, which lasted for about an hour included an in-depth discussion of social media and how it can be utilized to engage the University's alumni.",
